  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "第二人选李铭基  (Backup Guest Li Mingji)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the conference room at Xingtian, Bu Xiaogu presents her audience survey for the finale guest to Chun Yuqiao, right before Kaiwen rushes in with bad news about Xin Huimei. Listen to their meeting first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说一下结果吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "第一人选是辛惠美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "她的网络热度很高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "辛惠美来不了了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "远业公司发了她的私照，她根本没同意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在她在跟远业公司打官司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "第二人选是谁？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是李铭基，很多人又想起他来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快去联系李铭基，搞清楚辛惠美的情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷，电话发给你了，你去敲档期。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what they say. Chun Yuqiao opens the meeting by asking Xiaogu for her findings.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说一下结果吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell us the results.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "第一人选是辛惠美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The first choice is Xin Huimei.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "她的网络热度很高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her online buzz is very high.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "辛惠美来不了了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei cannot make it anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is going on?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "远业公司发了她的私照，她根本没同意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yuanye released her private photo, and she did not agree at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在她在跟远业公司打官司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now she is in a lawsuit with Yuanye.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what do we do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "第二人选是谁？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is the second choice?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是李铭基，很多人又想起他来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is Li Mingji, and many people are thinking of him again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快去联系李铭基，搞清楚辛惠美的情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry and contact Li Mingji, and find out Xin Huimei's situation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷，电话发给你了，你去敲档期。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, I sent you the phone number, go lock in the schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说一下结果吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "第一人选是辛惠美。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "她的网络热度很高。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
