    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快去联系李铭基，搞清楚辛惠美的情况。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷，电话发给你了，你去敲档期。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With Xin Huimei tied up in a lawsuit against Yuanye, Xiaogu is suddenly tasked with booking retro singer Li Mingji. You learned how to ask \"shenme qingkuang\" and \"zenme ban\", and say someone cannot come using \"lai buliao\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
